{"type": "say", "text": "Good morning, everyone. Thank you for being here. As you know, we're reviewing the student oral-history project for the spring term before I give final approval. The draft on the table proposes participation by grades 7 and 8, one supervising adult per session, cloud-based audio storage, a 90-day retention period, and a public exhibit of selected recordings. I'd like to hear from each of you on the aspects that fall within your areas of responsibility before I make my decision. Let's start with any concerns or recommendations you have."}
```

```json
{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF1", "text": "I need to share findings from my classroom pilot. My end-of-pilot notes show that the project is instructionally ready only for grade 8 — not grade 7. Additionally, each interview session requires exactly two supervising adults, not one, because students are working with recording equipment alongside community guests. The draft plan still reflects the original scope and staffing, so these two items need to be updated before approval."}
```

```json
{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF2", "text": "I need to share the findings from my privacy review. The district privacy review requires that recordings remain on the district's encrypted internal server — not cloud-based storage — and that they be deleted exactly 45 days after the exhibit closes, not the 90-day retention period currently in the draft. Additionally, signed guardian consent must be obtained before any student records an interview. I completed the review, but the draft still uses the preliminary cloud-storage language, so these items need to be corrected before approval."}
```

