{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF3", "text": "I need to share the findings from my archive and rights review. The review permits each public exhibit audio excerpt to be no longer than exactly 3 minutes, and it requires contributor attribution beside every excerpt. I completed the rights check, but these limits have not yet been added to the exhibit template, so these items need to be incorporated before approval."}
```

```json
{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF4", "text": "I need to share the findings from my family outreach review. Family outreach confirmed that consent materials must be available in exactly English, Spanish, and Arabic, and that paper consent forms must be offered in addition to the online form. I completed the outreach review, but the family-materials checklist has not yet been revised to reflect these requirements, so these items need to be incorporated before approval."}
```

